Z||000000||chris6878||02-28-2000||12:56 PM||||<BR>I was putting a manifold on my 85 SE V6 the other day....  (the back one..  it was a pain in the rear)  and noticed a  electrical plugin just hanging there....  its square looking, hanging down close to the a/c pump... i though it may go there but couldnt see where it might plug in at...<P>thanks for any info...<BR>chris....||||reg||5
Z||000001||wwh0001||02-28-2000||01:26 PM||||Could be you removed the deck lid wiring on the right side; especially if you took the lid off. when removed the plug in would fall down on top of your a/c . See if your trunk release works. <p>[This message has been edited by wwh0001 (edited 02-28-2000).]||||reg||1
